<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy | i4seer.com</title>
  <meta name="description" content="i4seer Privacy Policy. How we collect, use, and protect your information across Seer Frights, Tick, and our website.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <meta name="copyright" content="Institute for Seer LLC">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
</head>
<body class="landing-page">

  <!-- NAV -->
  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-top">
        <a href="/" class="logo" style="font-size: 1.6rem;">i4seer<span>Institute for Seer</span></a>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/" class="active">i4seer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/seer-frights/">Seer Frights</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tick/">Tick</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero" style="min-height: 30vh;">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="landing-title" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle" style="opacity: 0.5;">Effective Date: December 1, 2025</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PRIVACY -->
  <section>
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">1. Introduction</h3>
        <p>Institute for Seer, LLC, doing business as i4Seer ("i4Seer," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard information when you visit our website (i4seer.com), read our publications (including the Seer Frights book series), use our products (including Tick sensor devices and build-it project guides), or access our cloud services (Twin API).</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">By accessing or using our services, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">2. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p><strong>2.1 Information You Provide:</strong></p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li>Contact information (name, email address, phone number)</li>
          <li>Account credentials for cloud services</li>
          <li>Payment and billing information</li>
          <li>Communications you send to us (support requests, feedback)</li>
          <li>Order and shipping information</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>2.2 Information Collected Automatically:</strong></p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li>Device identifiers (MAC address, device ID) from Tick sensor devices</li>
          <li>Sensor readings and telemetry data transmitted to our cloud services</li>
          <li>Device logs, connection timestamps, and network metadata</li>
          <li>IP address and approximate geographic location</li>
          <li>Browser type, operating system, and device information</li>
          <li>Website usage data (pages visited, time spent, referring URLs)</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>2.3 Cookies and Tracking Technologies:</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">We use cookies, web beacons, and similar technologies to enhance your experience, analyze usage patterns, and remember your preferences. See Section 8 for details.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">3. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 0 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our products and services</li>
          <li>Process orders and deliver products</li>
          <li>Operate our cloud services and store your sensor data</li>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide customer support</li>
          <li>Send transactional emails (order confirmations, service updates)</li>
          <li>Send marketing communications (with your consent)</li>
          <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve our offerings</li>
          <li>Detect, prevent, and address security issues and fraud</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">4. Disclosure of Information</h3>
        <p>We may share your information with:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Third parties who perform services on our behalf (cloud hosting, payment processing, shipping, analytics)</li>
          <li><strong>Business Partners:</strong> With your consent, for joint marketing or product offerings</li>
          <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, court order, or governmental authority</li>
          <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets</li>
          <li><strong>Protection of Rights:</strong> To protect our rights, property, safety, or that of others</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">5. Data Storage and Security</h3>
        <p><strong>5.1 Storage:</strong> Your data is stored on servers located in the United States, primarily using Microsoft Azure infrastructure. By using our services, you consent to the transfer and storage of your information in the United States.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;"><strong>5.2 Security:</strong> We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption in transit (TLS) and at rest, access controls, and regular security assessments. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;"><strong>5.3 Retention:</strong> We retain your information for as long as necessary to provide our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. Sensor data in our cloud services is retained according to your account settings or until you delete it.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">6. Your Data, Your Responsibility</h3>
        <p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> You are solely responsible for the data you collect, store, and transmit using i4Seer products and services. This includes:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li>Ensuring you have proper consent to collect data from individuals</li>
          <li>Complying with all applicable data protection laws and regulations</li>
          <li>Maintaining appropriate backups of your data</li>
          <li>Implementing appropriate security measures for your deployment</li>
        </ul>
        <p>i4Seer is not responsible for the content, accuracy, legality, or appropriateness of data you collect or store using our products. You agree to indemnify and hold harmless i4Seer from any claims arising from your data collection practices.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">7. Your Rights and Choices</h3>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information</li>
          <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable format</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing communications</li>
          <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Withdraw previously given consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@i4seer.com" style="color: var(--warm-gold);">hello@i4seer.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">8. Cookies and Tracking</h3>
        <p><strong>8.1 Types of Cookies We Use:</strong></p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for basic website functionality</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors use our site</li>
          <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Remember your settings and choices</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>8.2 Managing Cookies:</strong> You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may limit some website functionality. Your cookie consent choice is stored locally and can be changed by clearing your browser data.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">9. Children's Privacy</h3>
        <p><strong>9.1 Our Audience:</strong> The Seer Frights book series is written for readers ages 8&ndash;12. However, our website and online services are not directed to children under 13 years of age.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;"><strong>9.2 COPPA Compliance:</strong> We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. Account registration, cloud services, and purchasing require a parent or guardian.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;"><strong>9.3 Parental Rights:</strong> If you believe we have collected information from a child under 13, please contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:hello@i4seer.com" style="color: var(--warm-gold);">hello@i4seer.com</a> and we will promptly delete such information.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">10. Build-It Projects</h3>
        <p>Our build-it project guides are educational content. We do not collect any personal data through the build-it projects themselves. If a build-it project includes a Tick device with Wi-Fi connectivity, data collection is governed by our cloud services terms above and by your own configuration choices.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">11. Third-Party Services</h3>
        <p>Our services may integrate with or link to third-party services including:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem 1.2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
          <li>Microsoft Azure (cloud infrastructure)</li>
          <li>Payment processors</li>
          <li>Analytics providers</li>
          <li>Shipping carriers</li>
          <li>Book retailers (Amazon, etc.)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These third parties have their own privacy policies. We encourage you to review them. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party services.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">12. International Users</h3>
        <p>Our services are operated from the United States. If you access our services from outside the United States, your information will be transferred to, stored, and processed in the United States where data protection laws may differ from your jurisdiction.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">13. Changes to This Policy</h3>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes by posting the updated policy on our website with a new effective date. Your continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid #222; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">14. Contact Us</h3>
        <p>For questions, concerns, or to exercise your privacy rights, contact us at:</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem;"><strong style="color: var(--text-bright);">Institute for Seer, LLC (d/b/a i4Seer)</strong><br>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@i4seer.com" style="color: var(--warm-gold);">hello@i4seer.com</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    <div class="footer-logo" style="font-family: 'Russo One', sans-serif; color: var(--text-bright); font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 3px;">
      i4seer
    </div>

    <p>&copy; 2026 Institute for Seer LLC. All rights reserved.</p>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/seer-frights/">Seer Frights</a>
